{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲版清楚地串起了温暖重新鲜活、无法接受失去、反复追问却改变不了现实距离的因果链，并明确指出不舍会催生下一次追问，而时间流逝造成的身体催迫不必等到思绪出现才发生；但对108–115的半音阶下行、低音追赶和上声部挣扎缺少贴近具体音响的解释，风暴与疲惫主要被概括为紧绷和时间压力。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙版不仅解释了温暖为何转为刺痛、持续加力为何无法换来安全并最终耗尽身体，还把细碎音符、低音追赶和上声部挣扎落实为具体的身体体验，并指出确认和用力反而会加深对自身费力的觉察；但思绪反刍的机制仍较概括，没有像甲版那样明确说明每次追问都改变不了现实距离、而不舍又不断催生新的追问，且对快乐会消逝和用力无效的解释有所重复。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙版保留了核心因果链和身体先于当下念头绷紧的机制，同时更具体地解释了音乐转折、身体反应及用力留住幸福反而加剧不安的反效果；甲版对反复追问的自我强化机制更精确，但这一局部优势不足以抵消乙版在音乐细节和身体机制上的补充。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9158d781-5914-44cb-80a7-a29b1c1f3f1f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T133847879725Z", "elapsed_seconds": 143.375, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:41:11.260794+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1bcf21324c3e75f371e0fd9dd6d987226f7c3974e57064760aac98a8d6ba04da", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3